    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "e011ad3e_e3bb87ba",
        "filename": "packages/Tethering/AndroidManifest.xml",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T12:24:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Question (mostly for Rémi) : the networkstack process is already persistent by virtue of being declared persistent in the NetworkStack manifest. Do you think we should list this here (which means it has to stay in sync, but someone reading this sees it\u0027s persistent), or that we shouldn\u0027t (which means it\u0027s not clear immediately here, but at least there is not duplication) ?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "8787221b2d456d37c47218fd06150e4f1b39c792",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "6fc09748_af8d8b43",
        "filename": "packages/Tethering/AndroidManifest.xml",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-24T04:25:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027d rather have it declare \"persistent\" itself, since the contents of this APK need to be persistent regardless of the other APK: Tethering will have its own persistent service independently of NetworkStack.",
      "parentUuid": "e011ad3e_e3bb87ba",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "8787221b2d456d37c47218fd06150e4f1b39c792",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "61273e9a_0a1a721a",
        "filename": "packages/Tethering/AndroidManifest.xml",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 34,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-10-12T04:03:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1 to declare \"persistent\" here and I don\u0027t find any harmful reason.",
      "parentUuid": "6fc09748_af8d8b43",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 34,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 34,
        "endChar": 33
      },
      "revId": "8787221b2d456d37c47218fd06150e4f1b39c792",
