    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "c50530b4_c899c266",
        "filename": "packages/Tethering/AndroidManifestBase.xml",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1015428
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-18T12:24:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Are you sure Tethering needs to be direct boot aware ? I don\u0027t think tethering can be turned on before storage is unlocked first after boot.\nhttps://developer.android.com/training/articles/direct-boot",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "8787221b2d456d37c47218fd06150e4f1b39c792",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "5418a211_d7e34711",
        "filename": "packages/Tethering/AndroidManifestBase.xml",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1288034
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-09-24T04:25:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I think it will have trouble being started by the SystemServer on boot otherwise, since the user will not have unlocked the phone yet. It should also be user-agnostic (I don\u0027t think we want to start it once per user), so it\u0027s probably tricky to tie it to user unlock.",
      "parentUuid": "c50530b4_c899c266",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "8787221b2d456d37c47218fd06150e4f1b39c792",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
    },
    {
      "key": {
        "uuid": "4070c00a_51910b1c",
        "filename": "packages/Tethering/AndroidManifestBase.xml",
        "patchSetId": 4
      },
      "lineNbr": 26,
      "author": {
        "id": 1308504
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-10-12T04:03:07Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yes, just like Remi\u0027s explanation. SystemServer may try to start tethering service before unlocked and we would get the crash if we don\u0027t add directBootAware here.",
      "parentUuid": "5418a211_d7e34711",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 26,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 26,
        "endChar": 38
      },
      "revId": "8787221b2d456d37c47218fd06150e4f1b39c792",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": false
    },
    {
